    "blurb": "Expert-led, structured Camunda migration approach",
    "overview": "Structured, fixed-price migration from Camunda 7 to 8  for both embedded and remote engines. Designed for reliability, transparency, and peace of mind.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Smooth migration. No surprises.",
    "splashDescription": "JIT's solution guides organizations through a structured, low-risk migration from Camunda 7 to Camunda 8. It covers all critical phases, from architectural alignment and process model analysis to API replacement, FEEL migration, and final deployment. With fixed-price packages, expert-led delivery, and full transparency across all steps, we remove complexity, reduce uncertainty, and ensure a reliable, future-ready Camunda platform. The approach includes technical readiness checks, architecture mapping, and migration of embedded logic into scalable, maintainable structures using job workers and the Zeebe engine.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/519694/overview/img8114419153163171643.png?ca6da368adc4a7de4c4e7919aebd5287",
